                        "entry_id": "c2ca8d1e-1523-3db0-81e4-2117609c8305",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A male given name from the Germanic languages brought to England by Normans."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "73858611-ff8d-456f-9a73-0c2ddd6ef8fe",
                                "sense_id": "480f05f6-835a-303e-a0db-8f76bc72b062",
                                "text": "Arnold used to be a name only a mother could love, but it does not mean nerd anymore. Since Arnold Schwarzenegger stepped out of the gym and onto the screen, it has come to suggest popping delts and giant pecs, a world of undisputed macho."
                            }
